# Request — bind or replace a person's name. ``who`` is a live track tag ("P3") or a
# person id ("person_7f92a1b3"); ``source`` records where the name came from
# ("app", "skill", "conversation") and is stored as the consent path. Names are not
# unique: renaming never merges two records.
string who
string name
string source
---
bool success
string message
string person_id
